OL,3,GNEWSACare home told to improve low food
OL,4,Ahygiene score
OL,5,
OL,6,FManagement at the Longlands Road care
OL,7,Fhome said they fully acknowledged the
OL,8,Frating and this was "not the outcome we
OL,9,Fexpect for our home". A spokesperson
OL,10,Fsaid all issues identified had been
OL,11,Ftaken seriously and had now been "fully
OL,12,Frectified".
